		{"id":"0df694aab47d19c7","type":"text","text":"The Ancient Water Wraith has lived inside of the ruins on the Solar Isles for an extremely long time (Since the Ran'tal were alive // do not have an exact time frame)\n\nIt speaks Sylvan and the language of the Ran'tal\n\nIt has memory loss due to how long it has been alive\n\nHe protects the ruins on the Solar isles against the Crimson Legion","x":-803,"y":-726,"width":508,"height":270,"color":"5"},
